# Frontend environment variables (Vite — only VITE_-prefixed vars reach the client).
#
# Local dev needs NOTHING here: useLiveScores falls back to a same-origin WebSocket URL
# that the Vite proxy forwards to the backend on :8081, and /api is proxied the same way.
#
# Production (frontend on Vercel, backend on Render) needs VITE_WS_URL set in the Vercel
# project's Environment Variables. The /api calls are proxied via vercel.json instead of
# an env var, so there's no VITE_API_URL.

# Absolute wss:// URL of the backend's STOMP WebSocket endpoint (live scores).
# Replace the host with your actual Render backend URL.
VITE_WS_URL=wss://onestopsports.onrender.com/ws
